WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:06.790
Hey, my name is Kibet. I'm one of the founders at Collie and Shoulder to Shoulder brings me basically two things

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:14.690
Primarily one is perspective. I love that there's different entrepreneurs from different backgrounds and different businesses

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:18.590
and they they we really try to challenge each other and

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:26.910
This perspective often helped me grow and also secondly in that aspect is like through the guided sessions at times

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:30.950
You will be prompted with different questions that might

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:35.830
Take you a bit in an uncomfortable zone or in a zone where you really have to think bigger

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:44.170
And I love that aspect because sometimes you are just limiting yourself for no good reason and that second aspect is the also the

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.950
Accountability which I really appreciate because I'm not sure about you guys

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:54.030
but if I commit to something I up hold myself to it much better and

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:59.230
Yeah, sometimes a bit uncomfortable, but this is a big nice way to grow
